      "body": "<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=80971660\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/nvidia-public-github/github/NVIDIA/transformerengine/-/pull/3686\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\n\n**[Medium impact]** The PR appears safe to merge; no actionable new issues were found.\n\n<h3>Summary</h3>\n\nThis PR makes `thd_read_half_tensor` zero unused trailing rows and corrects the K/V output offset for odd input row counts.\n- Half-tensor reads now zero unused rows after the last padded sequence.\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:5 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (2) · Last reviewed commit: [\"\\[PyTorch\\] Reproduce THD padding failure ...\"](https://github.com/nvidia/transformerengine/commit/cb1bb618bdd4984fe4f2ce2b7fb6bfc103cb4c65) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_expert&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=code_reviews&utm_content=nvidia/transformerengine)</sub>",
